 solutions. Founded in 1998, our company has grown to become a prominent force in exploration, production, and distribution of oil and natural gas resources. We leverage advanced technology and industry expertise to meet the world's growing energy demands responsibly.","font":"Montserrat","anchor":"t","box":[1504950,3419352,5966668,3306842],"lineH":423799,"ins":0}],"photos":[{"id":"6","w":7952422,"h":7952422,"area":0.336}]},{"n":3,"part":"ppt/slides/slide3.xml","role":"content","slots":[{"id":"11","kind":"title","chars":6,"max":9,"perLine":9.0,"lines":1,"caps":false,"sz":42.09,"paras":1,"text":"Vision","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[3758117,4328356,2385047,712107],"lineH":748411,"ins":0},{"id":"12","kind":"label","chars":7,"max":10,"perLine":10.2,"lines":1,"caps":false,"sz":42.09,"paras":1,"text":"Mission","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[11833645,4328356,2707962,712107],"lineH":748411,"ins":0},{"id":"13","kind":"text","chars":292,"max":292,"perLine":48.7,"lines":6,"caps":false,"sz":16.04,"paras":1,"text":"To be the most trusted and innovative leader in the global oil and gas industry, driving progress and sustainability through cutting-edge technology and responsible practices. We envision a future where our operations contribute to a cleaner, more efficient energy sector, fostering economic.","font":"Montserrat","anchor":"t","box":[2445285,5552221,5310178,2466605],"lineH":425831,"ins":0},{"id":"14","kind":"text","chars":279,"max":279,"perLine":46.5,"lines":6,"caps":false,"sz":16.04,"paras":1,"text":"Our mission is to responsibly explore, develop, and deliver energy resources that power the world’s progress. By aligning our efforts with these core principles, we strive to meet the evolving energy needs of today while paving the way for a brighter and more sustainable future.","font":"Montserrat","anchor":"t","box":[10532537,5552221,5310178,2466605],"lineH":425831,"ins":0},{"id":"15","kind":"label","chars":7,"max":14,"perLine":14.3,"lines":1,"c