ative, and efficient solutions to our customers.","font":"Montserrat","anchor":"t","box":[11263128,4732025,4466481,2300456],"lineH":342392,"ins":0},{"id":"20","kind":"title","chars":9,"max":10,"perLine":10.2,"lines":1,"caps":false,"sz":69.52,"paras":1,"text":"Solutions","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[11263128,3111644,4466481,1195013],"lineH":1236091,"ins":0}],"photos":[]},{"n":7,"part":"ppt/slides/slide7.xml","role":"content","slots":[{"id":"8","kind":"title","chars":44,"max":44,"perLine":14.7,"lines":3,"caps":false,"sz":49.37,"paras":1,"text":"Health, Safety, and Environmental Commitment","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[1570742,1933148,6442918,2609744],"lineH":877697,"ins":0},{"id":"9","kind":"text","chars":334,"max":334,"perLine":47.7,"lines":7,"caps":false,"sz":16.04,"paras":1,"text":"At Arowwai Industries, our commitment to health, safety, and environmental (HSE) excellence is fundamental to our operations and integral to our corporate values. We prioritize the well-being of our employees, communities, and the environment through rigorous standards and proactive measures. Here’s how we uphold our HSE commitment:","font":"Montserrat","anchor":"t","box":[1570742,5345599,5848230,2889780],"lineH":421767,"ins":0},{"id":"10","kind":"label","chars":7,"max":14,"perLine":13.7,"lines":1,"caps":false,"sz":26.73,"paras":1,"text":"Arowwai","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[806743,452534,2308445,455823],"lineH":475234,"ins":0}],"photos":[{"id":"6","w":7539976,"h":8017698,"area":0.321}]},{"n":8,"part":"ppt/slides/slide8.xml","role":"content","slots":[{"id":"10","kind":"label","chars":7,"max":12,"perLine":11.9,"lines":1,"caps":false,"sz":26.73,"paras":1,"text":"Arowwai","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[806743,452534,2008238,455823],"lineH":475234,"ins":0},{"id":"11","kind":"title","chars":21,"max":21,"perLine":10.5,"lines":2,"caps":false,"sz":49.37,"paras":1,"text":"Financial Performance","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[1570742,1933148,6442918,1732954],"lineH":877697,"ins":0},{"id":"12","kind":"text","chars":269,"max":269,"perLine":53.8,"lines":5,"caps":false,"sz":15.12,"paras":1,"text":"At Arowwai Industries, our robust financial performance underscores our position as a leading player in the oil and gas industry. We are committed to delivering strong financial results through strategic growth, operational efficiency, and prudent financial management.","font":"Montserrat","anchor":"t","box":[1570742,4051035,6442918,1941537],"lineH":397510,"ins":0}],"photos":[{"id":"3","w":3745449,"h":7550886,"area":0.15},{"id":"5","w":3348990,"h":7550886,"area":0.134},{"id":"7","w":7278894,"h":2071157,"area":0.08}]},{"n":9,"part":"ppt/slides/slide9.xml","role":"content","slots":[{"id":"5","kind":"label","chars":7,"max":12,"perLine":12.5,"lines":1,"caps":false,"sz":26.73,"paras":1,"text":"Arowwai","font":"Museo Moderno","anchor":"t","box":[806743,452534,2108307,455823],"lineH":475234,"ins":0},{"id":"6","kind":"text","chars":946,"max":946,"perLine":94.6,"lines":10,"caps":false,"sz":14.04,"paras":3,"text":"At Arowwai Industries, we are dedicated to driving excellence and innovation in the oil and gas industry. Our strategic vision, commitment to safety and sustainability, and strong financial performance underscore our role as a leading global energy provider. Through our key projects and extensive global presence, we are continuously advancing our capabilities and expanding our reach to meet the world’s energy needs responsibly and efficiently.\n\nOur focus on pioneering technology, operational efficiency, and community engagement reflects our dedication to creating long-term value for our stakeholders and contributing to a sustainable energy future. As we navigate the evolving energy landscape, we remain committed to upholding the highest standards of performance, safety, and environmental stewardship.\n\nWe invite you to connect with us to learn more about our projects, initiatives, and how we can coll